Third-party material redistributed in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The directory `.agents/skills/` contains agent skills vendored from external
repositories. They are development tooling, not part of the shipped application:
nothing under `.agents/` is imported by `src/`, and none of it is included in
the build output.

  .agents/skills/agent-browser/          vercel-labs/agent-browser
  .agents/skills/brainstorming/          obra/superpowers
  .agents/skills/code-review/            mattpocock/skills
  .agents/skills/code-skeptic/           local (no upstream)
  .agents/skills/frontend-design/        anthropics/skills
  .agents/skills/tailwind-4-docs/        Lombiq/Tailwind-Agent-Skills
  .agents/skills/web-design-guidelines/  vercel-labs/agent-skills

Each vendored copy remains under the license of its own upstream project, which
governs its use. The exact upstream revision and a content hash for every copy
are recorded in `skills-lock.json`.

Attribution note, stated precisely because it is incomplete: only
`.agents/skills/frontend-design/` ships its upstream license text alongside the
copy (`LICENSE.txt` within that directory). The other vendored skills are
redistributed here **without** their upstream license files. If you redistribute
this repository, review each upstream repository's license terms and include the
corresponding notices. This file records the obligation; it does not discharge
it.
